{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Self Cultivation of the Strong &quot;is a combination of developing a world map, third person survival shooting, and Roguelike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Without a woman in my heart, drawing a sword naturally becomes divine. To become a true powerhouse, one must pass the test of girls!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The greatest hero of the empire, are you ready to take on the challenge?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">*Game Features</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unique open world map<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557680/extras/\u5927\u4e16\u754c1920x1080.png?t=1741225141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Third person shooter with Roguelike, breaking through traditional gameplay to bring you a more fun experience<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557680/extras/3.png?t=1741225141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Elites have unique attack mechanisms, and every attack brings a deadly sense of crisis<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557680/extras/5.png?t=1741225141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random skill upgrade combinations bring unique surprises to every step of growth<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557680/extras/7.png?t=1741225141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The girls are rushing in like a tide, never tired? It's okay, powerful range skills help you harvest the hearts of girls<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557680/extras/8.png?t=1741225141\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3557680?t=1741225141","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557