steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557680/extras/5.png?t=1741225141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Random skill upgrade combinations bring unique surprises to every step of growth<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557680/extras/7.png?t=1741225141\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The girls are rushing in like a tide, never tired? It's okay, powerful range skills help you harvest the hearts of girls<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557680/extras/8.png?t=1741225141\" /></p>","developers":["PengStudio"],"fullgame":{"appid":"2931970","name":"cultivation of the strong"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3557680/0c804fee34d5dfab15c9d0a840fff2fa16ac252b/header.jpg?t=1741225141","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257107528,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107528/movie480.mp4?t=1741225136","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107528/movie_max.mp4?t=1741225136"},"name":"\u82f1\u8bed","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257107528/8af00fa2f59ac32df37a0a07dbad875661199ee6/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1741225136","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107528/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1741225136","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257107528/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1741225136"}}],"nam